# RuneScript sources. GitHub Linguist has no RuneScript language (only
# Linguist's own list can define a language and its color), so .rsc and
# .rsm files are counted and highlighted as ActionScript, the syntax family
# RuneScript comes from. The docs' code blocks use ```actionscript too.
*.rsc linguist-language=ActionScript linguist-detectable
*.rsm linguist-language=ActionScript linguist-detectable
